'''The Dead Keep Rolling''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] and appears every Tuesday. It is unlocked after clearing [[Unholy Tempest (Insane)|The Rolling Dead]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]] - Soba Cat.

